From 6c4a202291d5e59b541601f5ed516998bb632d05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aicss-genai <aicss-genai@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Apr 2026 11:51:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 01/12] sycl: Battlemage AOT + reorder MMVQ/dequant + async
 mem-op

Kernel and build fixes to make the SYCL backend run correctly on Intel
Arc Pro B70 (Xe2-HPG, BMG-G31).

- CMakeLists.txt: fix AOT to use spir64_gen target with proper device flag
- vecdotq.hpp: Q6_K SWAR byte-subtract scalarization for Xe2 SIMD16
- mmvq.cpp: Q5_K and Q8_0 reorder MMVQ dispatch (256-thread dp4a)
- quants.hpp: reorder-aware quant type traits for Q5_K/Q8_0
- ggml-sycl.cpp: supports_reorder dispatch for Q5_K/Q8_0, async mem-op plumbing
- dequantize.hpp: reorder-aware dequantize kernels for Q5_K/Q8_0
- convert.cpp: dequantize kernel launchers for reordered layouts
- mmq.cpp: minor matrix-multiply quant adjustments

Required to build and run correctly on BMG. Delivers a ~50x decode
improvement over the broken AOT baseline.
